Third-party artwork
-------------------
This repository does not contain vendor icons. `npm run icons` downloads them from their official public sources
into src/engine/icons.json and records the exact source, license and SHA-256 of every icon in
src/engine/icons.sources.json. Built packages (npm, .vsix) embed those icons.

- Google Cloud icons: https://cloud.google.com/icons (Google's terms for the icon pack apply).
- Microsoft Azure and SAP BTP icons: the icon libraries shipped with draw.io, https://github.com/jgraph/drawio
  (Apache-2.0; the vendors' own terms for their product icons apply).
- GitHub, GitHub Actions, Docker and JFrog logos: Simple Icons, https://simpleicons.org (CC0-1.0 for the SVG data).
  All product names, logos and brands are property of their respective owners and are used only to identify
  the products they represent; their use does not imply endorsement.
- docs/flex-left.svg and docs/flex-right.svg (README title): the flexed biceps emoji (U+1F4AA) from Noto Emoji,
  https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji, Copyright Google Inc., Apache-2.0; the right one is mirrored.

